### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3003/api
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}
@groupId = REPLACE_WITH_GROUP_ID

## ------------------------------------------------------------------------
## Authentication
## ------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1. Register a new user
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user7",
  "password": "securepassword"
}

### 2. Login user
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user7",
  "password": "securepassword"
}

## ------------------------------------------------------------------------
## Groups
## ------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3. Create a new chat group
POST {{baseUrl}}/groups
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "General Chat",
  "description": "A place for general discussions"
}

### 4. Get all groups for user
GET {{baseUrl}}/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Join a group
POST {{baseUrl}}/groups/{{groupId}}/join
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. Get messages for a group
GET {{baseUrl}}/groups/1/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
